{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Imam Mohammad Baqir (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اِمَامَ الْهُدٰی\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA EMAAMAL HODAA \nPeace be upon you, O Imam of guidance. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بَدَرَالدُّجٰی\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BADRAD DOJAA\nPeace be upon you, O full moon in the darkness. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا كَهْفَ التُّقٰی\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KAHFAT TOQAA\nPeace be upon you, O cave of piety. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا قَائِدَ اَهْلِ التَّقْوٰی\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA QAAA-EDA AHLIT TAQWAA\nPeace be upon you, O leader of the people of piety.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بَاقِرَ عَلْمِ النَّبِیِّیْنَ\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAAQERA I’LMIN NABIYYEENA\nPeace be upon you, O splitter of the knowledge of the Prophets. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا زَیْنَ السَّمٰوٰتِ وَ الْاَرْضِیْنَ\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ZAYNAS SAMAAWAATE WAL ARZEENA \nPeace be upon you, O adornment of the heavens and the earths. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ كَمَا جَعَلْتَهٗ عَلَمًا لِعِبَادِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA KAMAA JA-A’LTAHU A’LAMAL LE-E’BAADEKA\nO Allah, just as You made him a beacon for Your servants, \nوَ مُسْتَوْدَعًا لِّحِلْمِكَ \nWA MOSTAWD-A’AL LE-HILMEKA \na repository for Your clemency, \nوَ مُتَرْجِمًا لِّوَحْیِكَ \nWA MOTARJEMAL LE-WAHYEKA \nand an interpreter for Your revelation, \nفَصَلِّ عَلَیْهِ اَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّیْتَ عَلٰی اَحَدٍ مِّنْ ذُرِّیَّۃِ اَنْبِیَائِكَ \nFA-SALLE A’LAYHE AFZALA MAA SALLAYTA A’LAA AHADIM MIN ZURRIYYATE ANBEYAAA-EKA \nsend upon him the most excellent blessings You have ever bestowed upon any of the progeny of Your Prophets,\nوَ اَصْفِیَائِكَ وَ رُسُلِكَ وَ اُمَنَائِكَ یَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ\nWA ASFEYAAA-EKA WA ROSOLEKA WA OMANAAA-EKA YAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA.\nYour chosen ones, Your Messengers, and Your trustees, O Lord of the Worlds."
}
